      "text": "\u2500\u2500\u2500 image flow     - - - image barrier / layout transition (COLOR_ATTACHMENT \u21c4 SHADER_READ)\n*  passes marked * compile only under SWISH_DEBUG_UI; release skips SSAO/SSR/lum-pyramid/overlay.\nSSAA: shadow\u2192forward render at renderExtent (swap \u00d7 1.5); only Composite outputs at swap extent (downsample = AA).",
